scripts/lib.sh links libbendwall.so with libavcodec, libavformat, libswscale,
libswresample, and libavutil. FFmpeg is LGPL-2.1-or-later unless that build
includes GPL parts. Debian's ffmpeg package is built with --enable-gpl, and
its copyright file states that those binaries are GPL-2.0-or-later.
libbendwall.so linked against that FFmpeg can be distributed only on terms
compatible with the FFmpeg build it uses.
